          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Emergency direct connection (reset handling)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止接管并移除系统里的代理配置——浏览器等应用断网时的恢复出口，无需重启电脑。重启 app 可重新开启接管。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stops handling and removes the proxy config from the system — a recovery exit when apps like your browser lose connectivity, no Mac restart needed. Restart the app to re-enable handling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到疑似转发环：%@ 被反复捕获，已自动将来源进程旁路直连（见 设置 → 内置规则）。若仍反复出现，请检查上游 / 规则是否形成回路。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suspected forwarding loop detected: %@ is being captured repeatedly, so its source process was bypassed to direct automatically (see Settings › Built-in Rules). If it keeps happening, check whether the upstream or rules form a loop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
