    },
    "未在 appidge 进程中发现（终端里可能仍有，见下方诊断）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not found in the appidge process. Your terminal may still have them. See Diagnostics below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（可能是其它 VPN/TUN 型代理在 IP 层抢流量）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ (another VPN/TUN proxy may be grabbing traffic at the IP layer)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始使用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get started"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能认了系统代理或读了环境变量，直接连本地端口（回环）——appidge 看不到这类流量。终端里测：`env | grep -i proxy` 查有没有 HTTP_PROXY；有就 `unset HTTP_PROXY HTTPS_PROXY ALL_PROXY` 后再跑，appidge 就能接管并显示它。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It may follow the system proxy or read env vars and connect straight to a local port (loopback). appidge can't see that traffic. Test in the terminal: `env | grep -i proxy` checks for HTTP_PROXY. If it's set, run `unset HTTP_PROXY HTTPS_PROXY ALL_PROXY` and try again. appidge can then handle it and show it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它的流量可能已被 yunti 等聚合——活动栏里显示成 xray（本地代理出站），而不是原始应用名。关掉上游的系统规则模式即可让应用以自己的身份出现。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Its traffic may already be aggregated by yunti or similar. The activity list shows xray (the local proxy's outbound) instead of the original app name. Turn off the upstream's system-rule mode so the app appears under its own identity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能走 QUIC/UDP（HTTP/3）——appidge 默认拦截代理进程的 UDP 逼其回落 TCP；个别工具异常时可在「UDP / QUIC」里改「直连放行」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It may use QUIC/UDP (HTTP/3). appidge blocks UDP from proxied apps by default to force a TCP fallback. If a tool misbehaves, switch it to Allow direct under UDP / QUIC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "确认扩展在跑：状态栏是「引擎正常」、系统扩展「已接管」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirm the extension is running. The status bar shows Engine OK and the system extension shows Handling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部分应用走系统代理/环境变量，不经 appidge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some apps use the system proxy or env vars and skip appidge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有直连出站都由 appidge 按进程接管" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All direct outbound is handled per app by appidge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未设置（认系统代理的应用会直连 → appidge 接管）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not set. Apps that follow the system proxy connect directly, so appidge handles them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAC 脚本 · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PAC script · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "appidge 接管的是「直连出站」流量" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "appidge handles direct outbound traffic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用直接连远程服务器时，appidge 按进程接管、按你的规则转发到配置的上游（如 yunti 的本地端口）。这正是「设了全局代理却不生效」的开发 / AI / 科研工具能被接管的原因——它们本就无视代理配置、直连出网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an app connects straight to a remote server, appidge handles it per process and forwards it to your configured upstream (such as yunti's local port) by your rules. That's why dev, AI, and research tools that ignore the global proxy still get handled. They connect out directly and bypass proxy settings by design."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "appidge 看不到的：应用主动连本地代理端口（127.0.0.1）的流量——认系统代理或读环境变量的应用走这条路，属于回环，系统不会交给 appidge（平台限制）。这类应用其实已被本地代理处理，appidge 无需介入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What appidge can't see: traffic from apps that connect to a local proxy port (127.0.0.1) themselves. Apps that follow the system proxy or read env vars take this path. It's loopback, and the system never hands it to appidge (a platform limit). These apps are already handled by the local proxy, so appidge doesn't need to step in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机探测" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Machine probe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到会绕过 appidge 的代理层。若希望**所有**应用都由 appidge 按进程接管、在活动栏可见：把 yunti / Clash 等的「系统规则模式」关掉，只保留它的本地代理端口作为 appidge 的上游。这样每个应用都直连出站 → appidge 接管转发，没有回环盲区。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detected a proxy layer that bypasses appidge. To have **every** app handled per process by appidge and visible in the activity list, turn off system-rule mode in yunti, Clash, or similar and keep only its local proxy port as appidge's upstream. Then every app connects out directly, appidge handles the forwarding, and there's no loopback blind spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "某个应用没走 appidge / 看不到？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An app not going through appidge, or not showing up?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "活跃" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Active"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
